---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Base title="About S&B Plumbing Inc. | Ottawa">
  <section class="page-hero"><span class="eyebrow">Who we are</span><h1 class="section-title">A solid foundation.<br/><em>Thoughtful finishes.</em></h1><p>Residential craftsmanship and commercial know-how, brought together by a commitment to doing the job properly.</p></section>
  <section class="section-pad body-grid"><div class="reveal"><span class="eyebrow">S&B Plumbing Inc.</span><h2 class="section-title">Experienced in<br/><em>every detail.</em></h2></div><div class="reveal"><p class="lead">Based in the Ottawa area, S&B Plumbing Inc. works on new custom homes, full bathroom renovations and commercial plumbing projects.</p><p>Our experience spans residential construction, restaurants and institutional environments, including work at the University of Ottawa. We understand the different demands of every project: coordination, dependable workmanship and a finish that reflects the care put into the build.</p><p>Whether we're working alongside a builder on a new home or helping bring a bathroom renovation to life, the goal remains the same: quality work and clear, reliable execution.</p><a class="pill-link" href={base+'contact/'}>Get in touch <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
  <section class="section-pad services"><span class="eyebrow">How we work</span><h2 class="section-title">Good work starts<br/><em>with the right approach.</em></h2><ul class="values-list"><li><strong>Attention to detail</strong><span>Respect for the parts that will be seen and those hidden behind the finished wall.</span></li><li><strong>Experience across projects</strong><span>From custom residential construction and renovations to commercial and institutional environments.</span></li><li><strong>Built to last</strong><span>Careful planning, sound installations and practical solutions that work for the long term.</span></li></ul></section>
</Base>